WEBVTT

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.080
<i>The ''skeleton cities'' scattered
about the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.950
<i>Ruins of a civilization centuries old.</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:48.190
<i>Buried in them are all manners
of resources and lost artifacts.</i>

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:54.470
<i>People greedily dig, raze,
and mine for these buried goods.</i>

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:58.700
<i>As they're sucked dry,
these cities are numbered</i>

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.810
<i>in the order they're discovered
and then abandoned.</i>

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:05.530
<i>Cities under exhumation are named
after the individuals or groups</i>

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:09.150
<i>who have staked their claim in them.</i>

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:17.260
<i>We did it!</i>

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.880
<i>A city not on any map!</i>

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.660
<i>It DOES exist!</i>

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.000
<i>But let's save the glee
for after we inspect it!</i>

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:33.040
<i>Check it out! Aluminum!</i>

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.640
<i>I think this is titanium!</i>

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:38.540
<i>Sweet! All this and
we've barely even dug!</i>

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.250
<i>No doubt about it!
This city's been untouched, Kaizuka!</i>

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:47.040
<i>It's the 85th skeleton city discovered!</i>

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.660
<i>After the 84th skeleton city was
discovered 20 years previously,</i>

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:57.260
<i>the only new discoveries
were of small ruins.</i>

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:01.020
<i>These three men had made the
first big find in 20 years.</i>

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.000
<i>And then we ran into him...</i>

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.550
<i>R-run!</i>

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.130
<i>Kaizuka!</i>

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.650
<i>As I ran for my life,
I passed through the city gates.</i>

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:14.590
<i>He, the guardian, didn't follow me
outside the city wall.</i>

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.520
<i>That's how I survived.</i>

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:25.300
<i>All I managed to bring back
was my life and a cheap trinket.</i>

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:30.200
<i>I lost everything. I suddenly
lost my two trusted friends</i>

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.610
<i>with whom I’d worked for so many years...</i>

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:37.500
<i>This was some 10 years ago.</i>

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.040
That freak's been there that long?!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:43.380
<i>So the only thing you
managed to bring back was.</i>

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:47.790
<i>A computer drive that had thoroughly
deteriorated since the Dark Ages.</i>

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:52.720
<i>All that I managed to pull off
of it was the ''Game of Life''.</i>

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.960
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:58.200
<i>There was much more in the room
I found the drive in...</i>

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.230
<i>- Eh?!
- Eh?!</i>

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.230
- Eh?!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.830
<i>The room that made you filthy rich...</i>

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.470
<i>...has a lot more stuff...</i>

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:08.070
...on the same level
as the Game of Life?!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.040
<i>- That's a HUGE treasure trove!
- That's a HUGE treasure trove!</i>

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.040
- That's a HUGE treasure trove!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.710
<i>I know the room is in the
deepest underground part</i>

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:18.080
<i>of the building with the tallest tower,</i>

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.590
<i>but I only entered it
the one time 10 years ago...</i>

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:27.960
<i>I spent the next five years building
my company and selling the game,</i>

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.020
<i>and the next five after
that challenging him.</i>

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.930
<i>Wow, 10 years already...</i>

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.440
<i>So we just gotta get rid of him, right?!</i>

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.960
<i>I thought we'd be digging for treasure,
but you knew where it was!</i>

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:49.070
<i>This'll be a cinch!
The treasure is as good as ours!</i>

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.170
<i>Right?!</i>

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:56.620
10 million! 10 million! 10 Million!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.430
<i>B-but we'll have to fight
that monster thing, you know!</i>

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:07.500
<i>I know you can do it! After all,
you ARE the Kanto's best, right?</i>

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.300
I'll do it! I'll kill that sucker!

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.970
<i>Master!</i>

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:17.310
<i>OK! Then it's settled!
Let's take a break before we start!</i>

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.540
<i>I’m exhausted, and dripping with sweat...</i>

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.650
<i>I think I’ll go rest over there!</i>

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.550
<i>It's so cool!</i>

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.780
<i>Flaunter...</i>

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.080
<i>No peeking, now!</i>

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:40.260
Gonna peek all alone, you old fart?!

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.930
<i>Not peeking, monitoring.</i>

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:47.670
<i>I can't let word about my treasure
get leaked out to anyone!</i>

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.470
<i>That makes sense!</i>

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.080
Don't consent to that!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:57.810
<i>It'd be wiser to. Defiance of your
employer will nullify the 10 million.</i>

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:01.750
<i>It's specifically written
in your contract!</i>

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.720
<i>So just leave the important work to me!</i>

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:10.290
<i>You kiddos get ready to eat or something!</i>

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:11.460
<i>Now, then!</i>

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.860
<i>Oh, Junko-chan!</i>

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.960
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.970
Can't trust that geezer one bit...

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:24.410
<i>Master, I’ve been thinking...</i>

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:28.030
<i>Is that old man really after treasure?</i>

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.080
Whadya mean?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:35.920
<i>Well, he knew about the guardian.
This is too dangerous to be a hobby.</i>

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.220
What's he want, then?

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.800
<i>Could it be revenge?</i>

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:47.460
That's hilarious! Like anyone would
ever try that for 5 years straight!

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:50.700
<i>But he said it himself!</i>

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:56.870
<i>They were the only friends in the
Great Kanto Desert he could trust.</i>

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:03.610
<i>Wouldn't it be a once-in-a-century
thing for him to make such friends?</i>

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.020
<i>Am I wrong?!</i>

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:09.390
You're unusually inquisitive.
What's the deal?

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:16.560
<i>I’m not getting any of the 10 million,
so I find it hard to be festive.</i>

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:20.360
And you seem especially
unfond of Junko...

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.890
<i>Not really.</i>

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.530
You're jealous!

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:30.010
<i>Unbelievable! How can you
say that?! Don't be stupid!</i>

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:35.250
<i>I simply don't like how she uses
lousy lumps of fat to get her way!</i>

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:40.010
<i>Isn't she pathetic?!
I absolutely hate women like that!</i>

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.810
Damn kid!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.400
What the?!

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.340
<i>- Let's move!
- Go!</i>

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.600
<i>It's begun!</i>

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.670
<i>There's so many. Are they bandits?</i>

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.140
Doesn't seem like it...

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.670
That's him!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.700
<i>Master! In back!</i>

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:12.180
That bitch! Damn you!

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:15.190
<i>Junko-chan! I wondered
where she went!</i>

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:18.180
<i>What is she doing there?</i>

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.530
She was a spy.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:26.400
The legendary treasure hunting expert
was up to something,

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:31.750
so the Game of Life's rival company
probably sent her in!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:37.770
And now the first skeleton city found
in 30 years will be known to all,

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.580
and all of its treasure stolen!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.040
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.380
<i>Curse her! She'll pay for this!</i>

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.360
Old man...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.690
<i>What are we doing?</i>

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:59.260
Letting them handle the guardian
while we nab some treasure!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.730
<i>Good thinking!</i>

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:09.070
<i>I THOUGHT I recognized that scoundrel
from somewhere before!</i>

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.940
<i>Yes, those eyes...</i>

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:16.180
<i>His eyes have the light of
a well-sharpened, bared knife...</i>

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.310
<i>Such disturbing eyes!</i>

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.790
<i>- What is he, a monster?!
- He's fast!</i>

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:29.230
<i>Get behind him and attack from both.</i>

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.130
<i>Sorry! Buy a little more time!</i>

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.020
<i>That woman!</i>

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.200
<i>We get him?!</i>

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:51.550
Now to get me some treasure!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.780
That's.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.260
<i>Hold it.</i>

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.920
<i>Oh...</i>

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.260
<i>Hand over the treasure.</i>

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.830
<i>This? It's nothing special!</i>

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:09.100
<i>The old man said there was a lot more,
but this is all there was.</i>

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.020
<i>Traitor!</i>

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.200
<i>I haven't betrayed anyone.</i>

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:19.700
<i>Kaoru-chan agreed that I could
leave anytime if things turned bad.</i>

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.350
<i>What if I won't hand it over?
Will you shoot?</i>

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.120
<i>Can you shoot an unarmed woman?</i>

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.190
<i>I know you don't like
how l take advantage of men</i>

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.580
<i>by exploiting their weaknesses.</i>

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.820
<i>How cute!</i>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.640
<i>Hand it over!</i>

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.300
<i>Take it if you want it!</i>

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:51.370
<i>You big-chested airhead! Hand it over!
Hand it over! Hand it over!</i>

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:57.510
<i>You threw your gun away,
but I won't be so nice.</i>

00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:04.320
<i>Humiliated? Sucks for you that
I’ll stop at nothing to get what I want!</i>

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:08.690
<i>Listen. You'll die if you think too much!</i>

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:25.700
<i>Now we're even! See ya!</i>

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:36.190
Damn kid...!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.250
<i>This is humiliating!</i>

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.670
Looks like you finally got 'em all...

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:08.590
With enough money, there's always a way.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:12.090
And that old man's
spent five years on it.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:18.800
He's clearly not out for revenge.
I wasn't sure what the deal was, but...

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.960
...now I get it.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.340
What the hell..

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.340
...are you...

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.310
...fighting for?!

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:43.180
There's no one to thank you
or give you orders!

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:54.500
You're one tough bastard...

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.260
But...

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.300
...it's time to say goodbye!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:14.880
<i>I thought it was for sure this time,
but I guess it'll take another 5 years...</i>

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.580
I wouldn't say so.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.990
<i>You're alive!</i>

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:25.360
<i>But you don't seem to have
any treasure. What a failure.</i>

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:27.000
Don't be silly.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.990
Wasn't HE your real goal?

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.170
Don't worry. He's dead.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:38.440
<i>Y-you're certain?!
You're certain it's dead?!</i>

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.710
Don't worry, I took care of him! See?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.480
I finished him good!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.460
<i>Do you know what this was?</i>

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:55.510
Sure, more or less.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.460
<i>You ''more or less'' realized this
was worth more than the treasure</i>

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:04.470
<i>and that this was my true objective?</i>

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.210
Was I wrong?

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:11.810
<i>You're one despicable runt.
I bet you don't have any friends.</i>

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:15.010
Oh, you're much too kind!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.440
<i>That wasn't praise.</i>

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:21.180
Ya see, when you're a handyman,
you start hearing all kinds of rumors

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:26.210
and old stories, even in your sleep.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:28.930
Around the end of the Dark Ages,

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:33.190
there were perfect soldiers sent
onto the battlefield in place of people.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.930
They say that just one had
the combat ability of 100 men,

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:43.180
and that a single unit of them was
one cause of civilization's collapse.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:46.480
I dunno how much is true,

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:51.180
but once I saw it, I knew you weren't
after the underground treasure.

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:56.250
You've been doing tests on it
these past five years, haven't you?

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.850
To see if you could sell it or not...

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.960
<i>Diligently, so nobody
would ever find out.</i>

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:07.360
<i>Not even my company or my son...</i>

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.510
<i>Five years...</i>

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.040
<i>Look at it!</i>

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.810
<i>Burned by the sun and sand,
it continued to fight for five years</i>

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:18.310
<i>as it withstood its own heat.</i>

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.740
<i>Its scorched clothes
clinging to its body,</i>

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:25.150
<i>its armor battered
by countless bullets and heat...</i>

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.990
<i>It's gone without replenishment,
maintenance, or any support at all!</i>

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:32.690
<i>And as it had woken up
from centuries-long sleep,</i>

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:35.530
<i>it couldn't have been at 100% performance.</i>

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.100
<i>Even so, it displayed
spectacular combat capacity.</i>

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.760
<i>Its inherent abilities are unfathomable!</i>

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.780
Scary...

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.000
<i>Isn't it, though?</i>

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.270
I'm talking about you.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:58.150
For five years, you suckered guys
like me and set this thing after 'em.

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:02.210
Just how many did you kill?!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.740
<i>It's no big deal.</i>

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:12.500
<i>Just think if you had an army of
these armed robots to back you up...</i>

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:19.500
That's crazy!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.290
<i>Don't think too much,
don't think too much...</i>

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:31.780
<i>Don't think too much,
don't think too much...</i>

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.120
<i>Oh!</i>

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.080
<i>Hey, what're you.</i>

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:39.210
<i>Don't think too much,
don't think too much...</i>

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.920
<i>You never learn!</i>

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:45.920
<i>Don't think too much!</i>

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.240
<i>Alright!</i>

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:56.440
<i>Not bad. Why didn't you kill me?</i>

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.180
<i>Now we really are even.</i>

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.640
<i>Now strip. I’m taking you to my master.</i>

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:07.540
<i>I can't believe I lost! Crap!</i>

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.050
<i>I’m so soft!
I should've killed you when.</i>

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:13.680
<i>Keep your hands in the open!</i>

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.630
<i>Yeah, yeah...</i>

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.630
<i>Fine.</i>

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.290
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:28.070
<i>Good evening!</i>

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:32.580
<i>I didn't know where she had
weapons hidden, so I had her strip.</i>

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:35.750
What another great look!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.750
Alright, Asagiri Junko!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:41.470
<i>- I’m sorry! I’m sorry!</i>

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:41.470
- You filthy traitor!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.560
Well done, Taiko!
You suddenly have great character!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.260
<i>Yes!</i>

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:49.690
<i>I simply tried not to think too much!</i>

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.770
Now, then...

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:57.600
That robot's worth a lot, but it's
a threat to the Oasis government.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:02.140
If they found out, they'd probably
crush the Game of Life Company

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:06.610
and try to shut up everyone
who knows the secret.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.580
If we make your death look
like a convincing accident

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:13.680
then we'll be spared,
plus we can take our base fee.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:16.790
<i>You wouldn't have bothered
to finish off the guardian</i>

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:20.290
<i>if that was all you were going to do.</i>

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.290
This WAS a job.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:26.460
And besides, I'd much rather
have my 10 million!

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.430
- Be my guest.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:29.430
<i>- Even if you're murdered?</i>

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:33.340
There're plenty of people
out there who wanna kill me.

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.550
An extra person or two
won't make much difference...

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:41.410
Of course, I won't keep quiet
if something comes my way,

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.080
but I will tell you this.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:48.050
I've always upheld my contracts
and kept my employers' secrets secret,

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.990
and this time'll be no different.

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:54.690
Though I doubt the Great Kanto Desert's
most cautious treasure hunter

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:58.260
would ever believe me.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.460
<i>Not really.</i>

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.460
<i>Question!</i>

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:02.130
<i>Yes! Little one!</i>

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:05.030
<i>You're going to make lots of
those robots and sell them, right?</i>

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.070
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:11.470
<i>But didn't they play a part in the
destruction of the old civilization?</i>

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.210
<i>So what?</i>

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.680
<i>What if you make money</i>

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:19.120
<i>but humankind actually winds up
destroyed for good this time?</i>

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.620
<i>If it's destroyed that easily,</i>

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:26.460
<i>then let it be destroyed
and end the suffering.</i>

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.620
You're frightening.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.560
<i>After the Dark Ages, it was the
predecessors of us treasure hunters</i>

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:38.000
<i>who first stepped foot into the
hellhole that is the Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:42.210
<i>And once treasure began being dug up,
people gathered together,</i>

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:48.240
<i>dug wells, and built villages
that eventually grew into the Oases.</i>

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.510
<i>Which is why I don't like
the Oasis government,</i>

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.480
<i>which came in afterwards to sing
about the safety of the desert,</i>

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:58.150
<i>collect taxes, and force decisions
on us that suited their own whims!</i>

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:04.120
You're gonna use robots to
show the government who's who?!

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:10.000
<i>Things should be quite tumultuous
come 10 years from now!</i>

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.470
Ah well.

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:15.300
Say, I do get hush-money, right?!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.850
<i>Smaller one!</i>

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.580
<i>Y-yes?!</i>

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.750
<i>You get 10 million yen, too!</i>

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:33.690
<i>You certainly earned it.
Junko-chan's pay should about cover it!</i>

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:34.590
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.060
Quiet, you wench!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:40.960
You should be grateful
you still have your life!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.630
<i>Eh?! We're not killing her?!</i>

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.870
That'd be wasteful. I mean!

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:48.970
<i>This woman is our enemy now!
Get serious!</i>

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:54.610
<i>Boy! If you're alive in 10 years' time,
come see me! I’ll use you!</i>

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:59.510
I could be your enemy
when that time comes, you know!

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:12.330
<i>That boy has such ominous eyes!</i>

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:16.230
<i>The exact same eyes I had
when I was a kid...</i>

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:23.470
<i>And so another nightmare of the
Dark Ages is about to reawaken...</i>

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:56.450
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.880
<i>- Congratulations, boy!</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.930
<i>- At last, the Boobie Lady is mine!</i>

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:02.700
<i>What're you gonna do to me!? No! Stop!</i>

00:24:02.700 --> 00:24:05.380
<i>Can we really air this?!
Won't it be a storm of Sunabo marks?!</i>

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:07.600
<i>Next intimate episode-
''Crime and Punishment''</i>

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:10.120
<i>Miss it and you'll be my slave!</i>
